==Acquisition==
{{M|Archon Vitality}} is available from [[Chipper]] of {{Faction|Kahl's Garrison}} for 40 {{Resource|Stock (Kahl)}}, requiring players to be at '''Rank 3 - Fort''' to purchase.

==Notes==
*'''[[Abilities]]''' that inflict {{D|Heat}} status proc(s) will inflict '''one''' additional {{D|Heat}} proc that deals the same damage.
**Effect does not scale with mod rank. The mod can optionally be left unranked to save capacity.
**Can be triggered through {{Arcane|Melee Afflictions}} (from +6 to +7).
**Only some Warframes inflict {{D|Heat}} status procs:
***{{WF|Chroma}}'s {{A|Spectral Scream}} and {{A|Elemental Ward}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]].
***{{WF|Citrine}}'s {{A|Prismatic Gem}}.
***{{WF|Ember}}'s {{A|Fireball}}, part of {{A|Inferno}}, as well as {{A|Fire Blast}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]].
***{{WF|Gauss}}'s {{A|Thermal Sunder}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]].
***{{WF|Hildryn}}'s {{A|Pillage}} with {{M|Blazing Pillage}}.
***{{WF|Jade}}'s {{A|Light's Judgment}}, {{A|Ophanim Eyes}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]], and {{A|Glory on High}}.
***{{WF|Lavos}}'s {{A|Catalyze}} can imbue {{D|Heat}} to all other abilities excluding ones transferred via [[Helminth]].
***{{WF|Inaros}}'s {{A|Sandstorm}} with {{M|Elemental Sandstorm}} with heat on a melee weapon.
***{{WF|Koumei}}'s {{A|Kumihimo}} and {{A|Bunraku}}.
***{{WF|Mirage}}'s {{A|Sleight of Hand}} with {{M|Explosive Legerdemain}}.
***{{WF|Nezha}}'s {{A|Fire Walker}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]], {{A|Blazing Chakram}}, and {{A|Warding Halo}}.
***{{WF|Nova}}'s {{A|Null Star}} with {{M|Neutron Star}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]].
***{{WF|Protea}}'s {{A|Blaze Artillery}}.
***{{WF|Sirius}}' {{A|Coronal Ejection}} and {{A|Jade Stars}}.
***{{WF|Temple}}'s {{A|Pyrotechnics}}, which can be transferred via [[Helminth]], and {{A|Overdrive}}.
***{{WF|Trinity}}'s {{A|Link}} will add an additional {{D|Heat}} proc whenever a {{D|Heat}} status effect is redirected to linked enemies.
***{{WF|Voruna}}'s {{A|Fangs of Raksh}}, though only 1 extra heat status effect will be added, despite the ability adding 10.
***{{WF|Wisp}}'s {{A|Sol Gate}}.
***{{WF|Wukong}}'s {{A|Celestial Twin}} when equipped with {{A|Primal Fury}} modded for {{D|Heat}}.
***{{WF|Zephyr}}'s {{A|Tornado}} after absorbing {{D|Heat}} damage.
***{{WF|Uriel}}'s {{A|Infernalis}}, [[Demonium]] and {{A|Brimstone}} as well as effects from [[Uriel/Abilities/Passive|Passive Demons]].
***All [[Exalted Weapon]]s when modded with {{D|Heat}}.
*The additional {{D|Heat}} proc does not count for the purposes of {{Arcane|Cascadia Flare}} or {{Arcane|Arcane Hot Shot}}, and does not create any additional stacks on those buffs.

